# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
dev-dist
coverage
*.local

# webOS .ipk build output (regenerated with `ares-package webos`).
dist-webos/

# Build output served by the Caddy proxy (infra/). Regenerated from `dist/`,
# so it's ignored just like dist/ — see infra/docker-compose.yml for how to populate it.
infra/www/
# Rollback backup of the previous bundle, recreated on every deploy (see infra/deploy.sh).
infra/www.bak/

# Infra secrets (the *arr API keys the BFF holds). Never commit.
infra/.env

# Agent tooling scratch (skill registry / local agent state).
.atl/

